data 440
feat(lyrics): cascading spring delay animation for line transitions

- Per-line Spring instances for vertical offset animation
- 50ms staggered delay between consecutive lines below current
- Lines above current line have no delay (move normally)
- Underdamped spring (mass=1, damping=15, stiffness=100) for non-linear motion
- -40px initial offset springs to 0, creating cascading upward pull
- Lines outside viewport reset to zero offset
