author Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1784903898 +0800
committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1784903898 +0800
data 346
fix(lyrics): correct cascade offset direction and scale

- Offset was negative (-40px), pushing lines UP past the current line
- Changed to positive offset (lineHeight × 0.6 ≈ 13px), line starts BELOW
- Spring animates from positive offset to 0 = upward pull (correct direction)
- Offset now proportional to lineHeight instead of fixed pixels
from :286
commit refs/heads/rust-local-force
mark :288
