committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1784905930 +0800
data 332
fix(lyrics): cascade offset proportional to distance from current line

- Each line's initial offset now scales with distance: lineHeight * 0.6 * distance
- Line N+1: 13px offset, Line N+2: 27px, Line N+3: 40px
- Creates visible wave-like cascading delay effect
