committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1784952863 +0800
data 1374
feat(player): add drag transition between MiniPlayer and FullPlayer

Implement a drawer-style drag transition with cross-fade between MiniPlayer
and FullPlayer, with opacity linearly bound to drag distance.

- Introduce DraggablePlayerRoute (PageRoute subclass) with opaque=false so the
  underlying MiniPlayer remains visible during cross-fade. AnimationController
  is exposed to external gesture handlers for manual progress control during
  drag, and falls back to forward()/reverse() on release.
- Add global playerExpansion ValueNotifier<double> as single source of truth
  for transition progress; MiniPlayer and _MainLayout listen via
  ValueListenableBuilder / AnimatedBuilder to drive fade.
- MiniPlayer: rewrite to StatefulWidget, add vertical drag gesture that pushes
  the route on first valid drag and drives controller.value directly; tap to
  expand is preserved.
- FullPlayer (non-AM): add top drag handle bar, drive route controller on drag
  to collapse back to MiniPlayer.
- AmStyleFullPlayer: remove internal mini bar and spring mechanism (fixes
  double mini bar bug); reuse the same drag-to-collapse handle approach.
- app.dart _UpFadeMainRoute: listen to playerExpansion instead of the old
  isFullPlayerOnTop ValueNotifier (now a getter for backward compat).
- Delete dead _buildBlurredBackground (superseded by
  _buildCrossfadeBlurredBackground).
from :313
