committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1784957452 +0800
data 397
fix(player): prevent system back from dismissing FullPlayer without animation

Add PopScope(canPop: false) to both FullPlayer variants to intercept
system back button. On back press, dismiss() triggers controller.reverse()
for a smooth fade-out, then Navigator.removeRoute() removes the route
without re-entering PopScope. _isDismissing flag prevents double-trigger
from gesture/button callbacks.
