data 1146
feat(fonts): add custom font support for UI and lyrics

- Add FontSource enum and CustomFontLoader service for dynamic font
  registration via FontLoader, with SAF-based TTF/OTF file picking
  through a native MethodChannel
- Integrate font selection into ThemeProvider with persistent storage
  and propagate fontFamily through ThemeData, NavigationBarThemeData,
  ChipThemeData, AppBarTheme, and TextTheme so tab bar, chips, and
  titles follow the chosen font
- Fix race condition in MainActivity.onActivityResult where the picker
  result was cleared before the main thread delivered the callback
- Add independent lyric font source (LyricFontSource) in LyricPreferences,
  decoupled from the global UI font, with FontLoader registration and
  persistence
- Inject fontFamily into all lyric TextPainter/Canvas render paths
  (word_renderer, line_renderer, lyric_layout measurements, blur layer)
- Invalidate lyric line-height cache, blur image cache, and renderer
  bindings on font change so layouts and blur textures are recomputed
- Expose font selection UI in settings page for both global font and
  lyric font with bottom-sheet pickers
from :325
commit refs/heads/rust-local-force
mark :327
author Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1785026527 +0800
committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1785026527 +0800
data 598
fix(player): prevent ticker started twice error in FlowingBackground

Flutter 3.44 added assert(!_started) to Ticker.start(), causing
'A ticker was started twice' when isPlaying transitions false->true
after initState already started the ticker. Also fixes the
_dependents.isEmpty assertion on route dismiss by stopping the
ticker in deactivate before the subtree deactivates.

- Introduce _isRunning state and _setRunning() idempotent helper
- initState now starts ticker based on widget.isPlaying
- didUpdateWidget routes through _setRunning
- deactivate and dispose both call _setRunning(false)
from :326
commit refs/heads/rust-local-force
mark :328
author Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1785027855 +0800
committer Little-White3110 <Little-White3110@users.noreply.github.com> 1785027855 +0800
data 751
fix(player): prevent system bar flicker with flowing background enabled

The AnnotatedRegion used SystemUiOverlayStyle.light while
applyImmersiveForOrientation's portrait branch set a different
const SystemUiOverlayStyle. Since SystemUiOverlayStyle does not
override ==, the reference inequality caused every didChangeMetrics
cycle (window insets jitter amplified by the FlowingBackground
ticker) to actually invoke the platform channel and reset the system
bars, producing visible flicker.

- Export a shared const kPlayerOverlayStyle from landscape_immersive
- AnnotatedRegion and applyImmersiveForOrientation both reference it
- didChangeMetrics now debounces on physical size to skip insets-only
  changes that don't reflect an orientation change
from :327
