data 805
feat(settings): add keep-screen-on toggle while playing songs and MVs; fix(player): center album art in landscape zen mode

Add a settings switch (default off) that keeps the screen on while a song or MV is playing, using a native MethodChannel with FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON (no new dependencies). Introduce WakelockService singleton that merges the setting flag with song/video playback state. Wire playback hooks into PlayerProvider (song) and MvPlayerPage (video).

Fix album artwork not vertically centered in landscape/expanded layouts after entering zen mode: the top-bar height compensation Padding(bottom: 56) was still applied after the top bar collapsed to 0 via _ZenFade, shifting artwork up ~28px. Now the bottom padding switches to 0 in zen mode across 4 layouts (MD3 + AM, landscape + expanded).
