data 860
perf(playlist): stop full-page rebuild on scroll and cache filter result

- P0: _onScroll no longer setState()s the whole page; only updates
  ValueNotifier<double>, ValueListenableBuilder rebuilds SliverAppBar
  locally (gradient + title fade-in). List items / MiniPlayer stay
  intact during scroll.
- P0: _displaySongs now caches the filter result (_cachedFilteredSongs),
  keyed by sort/search inputs. Previously every itemBuilder call (every
  new visible row during scroll) re-ran the O(N) playable-filter hook
  introduced by installUiHooks (enhanced_ui.dart).
- ListenableBuilder builder switched to block body so the first line
  invalidates the filter cache when songFilterListenable notifies.

Static: flutter analyze clean (no new error/warning).
Verified: builds 43s, mDNS-TLS install -r Success, App starts
without Flutter/AndroidRuntime errors.
